  m_text: 'Ethan wakes inside an abandoned cinema surrounded by scattered film reels,
    broken lights, and an empty screen waiting to speak.

    Each reel reveals a
    missing part of the night a girl disappeared.

    The final frame holds the
    truth Ethan tried to leave behind.'
